<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA WIN 25-17.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ARGENTINA WIN 25-17.</headline>
<dateline>REDRUTH, England 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat South West 25-17 (halftime 15-5) in a rugby union tour match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>South West - Tries: Julian Davies, penalty try, Nick Southern. Conversion: Andy Green</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Diego Albanese, Carlos Promanzio, Eduardo Simone, Tomas Solari. Conversion: Jose Cilley. Penalty: Cilley.</p>
</text>
